@startuml
title E Visa Processing And Follow Up System - State Diagram

[*] --> CreateAccount

state "Create Account" as CreateAccount
state "Logged In" as LoggedIn
state "Application Created" as ApplicationCreated
state "View Status" as ViewStatus
state "Check Status" as CheckStatus
state "Cancel Application" as CancelApplication
state "Modify Details" as ModifyDetails
state "View Details" as ViewDetails
state "View Purpose" as ViewPurpose
state "Feedback Given" as FeedbackGiven
state "Logged Out" as LoggedOut

CreateAccount --> LoggedIn : Login

LoggedIn --> ApplicationCreated : Apply For Visa, Make Payment

ApplicationCreated --> ViewStatus : View Status

ViewStatus --> CheckStatus : Check Status

CheckStatus --> ViewStatus : View Status

ApplicationCreated --> CancelApplication : Cancel Application

LoggedIn --> ModifyDetails : Modify Details

ModifyDetails --> ViewDetails : View Details

ViewDetails --> ViewPurpose : View Purpose of Application

ViewPurpose --> ViewStatus : Update Status Based on Document Check, Visa Approved or Rejected

CheckStatus --> FeedbackGiven : Give Feedback

FeedbackGiven --> LoggedOut : Log Out

LoggedIn --> LoggedOut : Log Out

ApplicationCreated --> LoggedOut : Log Out

@enduml
